step Green Iron Bracers to 175
  tip Green Iron Bracers is orange at 150 (yellow 165, green 177, grey 190): about 28 crafts to 175, up to 31 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 6 Iron Bar and 1 Green Dye. Six Iron Bars and a Green Dye a craft; Green Dye comes from tailoring, leatherworking and trade supplies vendors. Orange to 165 on Forever, so a point every craft for the first fifteen. Needs an anvil nearby.
  craft 3501 until 175

