step Golden Scale Bracers to 185
  tip Golden Scale Bracers is orange at 175 (yellow 185, green 197, grey 210): about 10 crafts to 185, a point every craft. Each takes 5 Steel Bar and 2 Heavy Grinding Stone. Make the 20 Heavy Grinding Stone first. Steel Bars are smelted from an Iron Bar and a Coal (Mining 165; Coal from trade and blacksmithing suppliers), so each bracer is five of each. Each bracer takes two Heavy Grinding Stones: make them first. Needs an anvil nearby.
  craft 3337 x20
  craft 7223 until 185

step Smelt Mithril
  tip A Mining trainer teaches Smelt Mithril (Mining 175, 50s): the bars of the next stretch are smelted from what you mine.
