step Steel Plate Helm to 215
  tip Steel Plate Helm is orange at 200 (yellow 210, green 220, grey 230): about 16 crafts to 215, up to 18 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 14 Steel Bar and 1 Solid Grinding Stone. Make the 16 Solid Grinding Stone first. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data. Specialisation (optional): at 200 and character level 40, Grumnus Steelshaper (Ironforge) or Okothos Ironrager (Orgrimmar) starts The Art of the Armorsmith: 4 Ornate Mithril Helms, 2 Ornate Mithril Boots and an Ornate Mithril Breastplate, whose plans come from a Mithril Order quest chain. Ironus Coldsteel (Ironforge) or Borgosh Corebender (Orgrimmar) starts The Way of the Weaponsmith: 4 Moonsteel Broadswords, 4 Massive Iron Axes, 2 Heavy Mithril Axes and 2 Big Black Maces; on Forever the Moonsteel Broadsword plans (Zarena Cromwind, Booty Bay) and Massive Iron Axe plans bind when picked up, so buy and use them yourself. You can take only one; neither is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30). Needs an anvil nearby.
  craft 9920 x16
  craft 9935 until 215

