  tip Mine from Mining 237 to 245 for Heavy Mithril Boots: this loop gives Mithril Ore, and the next one the rest from Mining 245. The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap.
