step Blacksmithing recipes at 215
  tip Heavy Mithril Boots (from 210) is taught only by the Artisan trainers: Alliance Brikk Keencraft (Stranglethorn Vale); Horde Brikk Keencraft (Stranglethorn Vale). You can train Artisan there now if you are level 35 (it needs Blacksmithing 200), which saves the trip at 225.
