step Heavy Mithril Boots to 225
  tip Heavy Mithril Boots is orange at 215 (yellow 230, green 240, grey 250): about 10 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 14 Mithril Bar and 4 Thick Leather. Mithril Bars from Mithril Deposits; Thick Leather from skinners or the Auction House. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmithing 225 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 9968 until 225
  skill Blacksmithing 225

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan (225-300)
section Blacksmithing 225-300

step Artisan Blacksmithing
  tip Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 5g (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Blacksmithing 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Brikk Keencraft (Stranglethorn Vale); Horde Brikk Keencraft (Stranglethorn Vale). This route trains it at Brikk Keencraft (Stranglethorn Vale) for the Alliance and Brikk Keencraft (Stranglethorn Vale) for the Horde, who also teach the recipes of 225-300: one trainer for every visit. Learn now: Dense Weightstone (from 225). 225-300 takes 154 Mithril Bar, 5 Aquamarine, 20 Star Ruby, 30 Rugged Leather, 550 Thorium Bar and 24 Dense Stone to gather or buy. From 265 the route splits: with Radiant plans, about 36 more crafts and 152 Heart of Fire and 586 Thorium Bar; with Derotain's plans, about 40 crafts and 37 Aquamarine, 45 Star Ruby and 1458 Thorium Bar.
  level 35
  train Blacksmithing Artisan npc 2836 only Alliance
  train Blacksmithing Artisan npc 2836 only Horde
  learn 16640 npc 2836 only Alliance
  learn 16640 npc 2836 only Horde

step Get Aquamarine
  tip 5 Aquamarine for Blacksmithing 225-300: 5 Imperial Plate Belts. Aquamarine turns up in about one Truesilver Deposit or Ooze Covered Truesilver Deposit in 500: keep the ones you find while mining. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 7909 x5 anywhere gather Mining 125
  auction 7909 x5

step Get Star Ruby
  tip 20 Star Ruby for Blacksmithing 225-300: 20 Imperial Plate Bracers. Star Ruby turns up in about one Truesilver Deposit or Ooze Covered Truesilver Deposit in 143: keep the ones you find while mining. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 7910 x20 anywhere gather Mining 175
  auction 7910 x20

