  tip 154 Mithril Bar for Blacksmithing 235-240: 11 Heavy Mithril Boots; from your mining on the way: 10 of 154 Mithril Ore. Mine 144 Mithril Ore at the loops of Mining 230-245, the richest in it (they give no more points), smelt 154 Mithril Bar at a forge, then craft 8 Heavy Mithril Boots (Blacksmithing 235 to 240). The arrow takes the Mining loop that gets you them soonest from where you are and walks it until your bags hold them; the window names the loop, its lap and the laps left. Or buy them at the Auction House.
