  tip Mine from Mining 272 to 275 for Imperial Plate Belt: this loop gives Thorium Ore, and the next one the rest from Mining 275. The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap.
