  when knows 16656
  tip Radiant Boots is orange at 265 (yellow 285, green 295, grey 305): about 27 crafts to 291, up to 29 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 14 Thorium Bar and 4 Heart of Fire. Its pattern (Plans: Radiant Boots) drops from mobs all over the world and does not bind: buy it at the Auction House. Fourteen Thorium Bars and four Hearts of Fire a craft; orange to 285. Needs an anvil nearby.
  craft 16656 until 291

