step Radiant Leggings to 300
  when knows 16656
  tip Radiant Leggings is orange at 291 (yellow 300, green 310, grey 320): about 9 crafts to 300, a point every craft. Each takes 20 Thorium Bar and 4 Heart of Fire. Its pattern (Plans: Radiant Leggings) drops from mobs all over the world and does not bind: buy it at the Auction House. The last points: buy the plans when you reach 280; until then the boots carry you. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmithing 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
  learn 16725 -- from the pattern bought at the Auction House
  craft 16725 until 300
  skill Blacksmithing 300

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan, with Derotain's plans (265-300)
section Blacksmithing 265-300

step Get Aquamarine
  when !knows 16656
  tip 37 Aquamarine for Blacksmithing 265-300: 37 Imperial Plate Boots. Aquamarine turns up in about one Truesilver Deposit or Ooze Covered Truesilver Deposit in 500: keep the ones you find while mining. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 7909 x37 anywhere gather Mining 125
  auction 7909 x37

step Get Star Ruby
  when !knows 16656
  tip 45 Star Ruby for Blacksmithing 265-300: 8 Imperial Plate Bracers and 37 Imperial Plate Boots. Star Ruby turns up in about one Truesilver Deposit or Ooze Covered Truesilver Deposit in 143: keep the ones you find while mining. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 7910 x45 anywhere gather Mining 175
  auction 7910 x45

