  when !knows 16656
  zone Tanaris
  tip Derotain Mudsipper (Tanaris) trades Plans: Imperial Plate Boots (Blacksmithing 270) for 40 Thorium Bar in Imperial Plate Boots, which needs Blacksmithing 240 and character level 50. The plans bind when picked up.
  accept 7654
  turnin 7654

step Imperial Plate Boots to 300
  when !knows 16656
  zone Azeroth
  tip Imperial Plate Boots is orange at 270 (yellow 290, green 300, grey 310): about 34 crafts to 300, up to 37 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 34 Thorium Bar, 1 Star Ruby and 1 Aquamarine. Thirty-four Thorium Bars, a Star Ruby and an Aquamarine a craft, orange to 290: the plans you can always get past 270. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmithing 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
